meta {
  name: Services
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Staff CMS for every block on `/services/{slug}`.

  Run **Public / Auth / Login** first. The collection script attaches `ACCESS_TOKEN`.

  | Request | Uses |
  |---|---|
  | List / Get Service | `SERVICE_ID` — seeded row (`web-platforms`) |
  | Create → Get Demo → Update → Delete | `DEMO_SERVICE_ID` (`bruno-crud-service`) |

  List also stores `SERVICE_ID` from `SERVICE_SLUG` so Get works on Local or Production.
}
